OL,4,CDuran Duran guitarist Andy Taylor dies 
OL,5,Caged 65                                
OL,6,GAndy Taylor, the guitarist for the pop 
OL,7,Ggroup Duran Duran, has died at the age 
OL,8,Gof 65.                                 
OL,10,FBorn in Tynemouth, he co-wrote some of 
OL,11,Fthe group's biggest hits, including    
OL,12,FSave A Prayer, Rio and Girls On Film;  
OL,13,Fand also worked with artists like      
OL,14,FRobert Palmer, Rod Stewart and Belinda 
OL,15,FCarlisle.                              
OL,17,FIn a statement, his bandmates said     
OL,18,FTaylor had fought "a long and          
OL,19,Fcourageous battle with prostate        
OL,20,Fcancer" and "passed away peacefully at 
OL,21,Fhome, surrounded by his family, on     
OL,22,FMonday 23 November".                   
